  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Medical Stores Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this funding is to assume control and responsibility of the management of the central medical stores of Liberia from the Liberian ministry of health (mMOH) and provide improved inventory management of pharmaceuticals and commodities, ensure pharmaceuticals and commodity security, maintain the viability of pharmaceuticals, and ensure the availability of pharmaceuticals and commodities throughout all counties of Liberia.</narrative>
  </description>
